<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - FAKTO H1 LOSS 404,000 KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - FAKTO H1 LOSS 404,000 KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>					(million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net loss				  404,000 vs profit 234,000</p>
<p> Turnover				     84.7 vs 70.6</p>
<p> Operating costs			    84.7 vs 67.7</p>
<p> Operating profit			   2.9  vs 2.9</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss			    404,000 vs profit 234,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Fakto is a Nissan retailer and service centre and is</p>
<p>part of the Fakto group. The group includes a Nissan wholesaler</p>
<p>and distributer, a Fiat dealership and a car rental company.</p>
<p>Fakto Group's H1 profit was 773,000 kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
